  "description": "ROMJOU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H94 Co2 Dy4 N6 O24 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Co1A (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.142-3.923 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.38-111.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H94N8O30Co2Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
